 "remarks": "Beautifully set on a quiet cul-de-sac, this four-bedroom, two-bath raised ranch offers comfortable living and convenient access to I-95. The inviting layout features a living room and dining room combination, an eat-in kitchen, and a spacious family room with a fireplace and sliders leading to the patio and upper deck. The lower-level bathroom includes a washer and dryer. Outside, enjoy the professionally landscaped yard, complete with an above-ground pool and shed. A two-car attached garage adds everyday convenience. Easy to show. Sale is subject to probate court approval.",
